er: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 601.70px; height: 401.33px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztadKJcwGw-z6htnC5DuLcI9_9Q6UKOtRv-tO7At_H8Bvl00RmeZW26BFOQksjHzrlarkwlLVv0mLNF_iZPJK64h13TUe9fDtQiQJQD-IcRznbo0iJaDpOTay_Uq1ZnH33RnUtiBmotfUtgES-IxS9UlZnI6kmK_5w=s320" style="width: 601.70px; height: 401.33px; margin-left: -0.00px; margin-top: -0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span>The </span><span style="font-weight:700">AI StudyBuddy </span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;backend follows a modular RESTful architecture designed to provide secure, scalable, and AI-powered learning services. The system processes client requests through Express.js, validates users using JWT authentication, interacts with the MongoDB database for data storage, and communicates with the Google Gemini AI API to generate intelligent study resources.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The architecture separates authentication, business logic, AI services, and database operations into independent modules, making the application easier to maintain, extend, and debug.</span></p><h3 id="h.k0e9cewd3oo" style="padding-top:14pt;