;;font-style:normal">JWT-based middleware verifies user identity, protects private routes, and ensures that only authenticated users can access AI services and study resources.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">â€¢ Route Handlers: </span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Routes manage API endpoints related to user authentication, study materials, AI features, and administrative operations.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">â€¢ AI Service Layer: </span><span>A dedicated AI service communicates with the </span><span style="font-weight:700">Google Gemini API</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;to generate summaries, quizzes, flashcards, and personalized study plans based on the user's study content.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">â€¢ Database Layer: </span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">MongoDB, together with Mongoose ODM, stores user information, uploaded study materials, and AI-generated learning resources securely.</span></p><h2 id="h.ua261rbhgwv3" s