;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Key Relationships</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_list_7-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:0pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">User â†’ Study Material (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;A user can upload multiple study materials.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">Study Material â†’ Summary (One-to-One):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Each uploaded material can have one AI-generated summary.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">Study Material â†’ Flashcards (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;One study material can generate multiple flashcards.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">Study Material â†’ Quiz (One-to-One):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;One study material can generate one quiz containing multiple questions.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">User â†’ Study Plan (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;A user can generate multiple study plans based on different subjects or examination schedules.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Arimo&quot;">User â†’ AI Resources (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;All AI-generated summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and study plans are associated with the user who generated them.</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.8qlx5jc259dx" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Key Features</span></h2><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The AI StudyBuddy &nbsp;backend provides intelligent learning assistance through secure and scalable REST APIs. The major features of the system are as follows:</span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_10-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:0pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Secure User Authentication:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Implements JWT-based authentication with encrypted passwords using bcrypt for secure user access.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">Study Material Management:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Allows users to upload and manage study materials that serve as input for AI-powered learning features.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">AI Summary Generation:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Generates concise and easy-to-understand summaries from uploaded study content using the Google Gemini API.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">AI Flashcard Generation:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Automatically creates flashcards from study materials to improve concept revision and active recall.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">AI Quiz Generation:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Produces multiple-choice quizzes based on uploaded content, enabling students to test their knowledge.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">AI Study Plan Generation:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Generates personalized study plans according to the user's learning goals and available study time.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="font-weight:700">Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Provides different access privileges for Students and Administrators to ensure secure system management.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">MongoDB Data Storage:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Efficiently stores user information, uploaded materials, and AI-generated learning resources using MongoDB.</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.uq6edbrf4v0z" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Roles and Responsibilities</span></h2><h3 id="h.ascnnks8m0c1" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Student</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Students are the primary users of the system. They can register, log in securely, upload study materials, and utilize AI-powered features such as summary generation, flashcard creation, quiz generation, and personalized study plans. Students can also view and manage their previously generated learning resources.</span></p><h3 id="h.7136n6744v6s" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Administrator</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span>Administrators manage the overall system and ensure its smooth operation. They monitor registered users, manage user accounts, oversee application usage, maintain system integrity, and ensure that AI-powered services function correctly. Administrators also have permission to perform system-level management tasks and resolve user-related issues.</span></p><h2 id="h.dycgxuq1y1lb" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">User Flow</span></h2><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The AI StudyBuddy &nbsp;application begins with the user registering or logging into the system. After successful JWT-based authentication, the user is redirected to the dashboard, where they can upload study materials and access AI-powered features. Based on the uploaded content, the system generates summaries, flashcards, quizzes, or personalized study plans using the Google Gemini API. All generated resources are displayed to the user and can be saved for future reference. Users can also manage their profile and view their previously generated learning resources through the dashboard.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 601.70px; height: 401.33px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztaGVAJBLZy6aqwVe_-Qwc8UiEddJXS1l9J7wGoramNMFaBCVmCN22XiNtsGu5tP-PH8iA0WT1OzKUelA_bw4wwfrm3sCdvc0iKqiM0ju7NF4vx6P21Z_Ede2KmQEj5ZFzrAUun6EieF638EG_qzTjNiimEfaiM=s320" style="width: 601.70px; height: 401.33px; margin-left: -0.00px; margin-top: -0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.d614udcls8c7" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">MVC Architecture Pattern</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 601.70px; height: 365.33px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztYc0gxmhHhh5t1yz9gXFA6JifTe6d47zPo5hLkxtdsAzERsKCJj6U1M6Kog6b6HvGh6pznhOpC1x9Z04Xh93pLxNOtupOMKhlyiGmFwPVZHZHSo4GEWiOHE9BcfocCVCqKphH89JsltrMcJ4m2j609ACbSfT00=s320" style="width: 601.70px; height: 365.33px; margin-left: -0.00px; margin-top: -0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span>The </span><span>AI StudyBuddy</span><span>&nbsp; backend follows the </span><span style="font-weight:700">Model-View-Controller (MVC)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;architecture to organize the application into separate layers, making the code modular, maintainable, and scalable.</span></p><h3 id="h.5swwhnod2yjh" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Model Layer (Data Layer)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The Model layer defines the MongoDB collections using Mongoose schemas. It is responsible for managing user information, uploaded study materials, and AI-generated learning resources while ensuring data validation and database interactions.</span></p><h3 id="h.md95pq9gy337" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">View Layer (API Response Layer)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span>Since </span><span>AI StudyBuddy</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp; is a backend REST API, there is no traditional user interface in the View layer. Instead, the API returns structured JSON responses to the React frontend, allowing users to interact with the application through REST endpoints.</span></p><h3 id="h.z0v65sf1ivij" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Controller Layer (Business Logic)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The Controller layer processes incoming API requests, validates user input, performs authentication and authorization, communicates with the database models, invokes the Google Gemini AI service when required, and returns the appropriate response to the client.</span></p><h3 id="h.y3o4nbr1f2d9" style="padding-top:14pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">MVC Benefits</span></h3><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The MVC architecture separates data management, business logic, and client communication into independent components. This improves code readability, simplifies debugging and testing, and allows new features to be integrated without affecting existing modules.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h1 id="h.3a2ai7rpcas9" style="padding-top:24pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:20pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:23pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Epic 2: Project Setup and Configuration</span></h1><h2 id="h.1h2mog8c