al&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.crw5qvfxughn" style="padding-top:24pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Epic 3: Backend Development</span></h2><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0792;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:12pt">The AI StudyBuddy &nbsp;backend is developed using </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700">Node.js</span><span style="font-size:12pt">, </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700">Express.js</span><span style="font-size:12pt">, and </span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700">MongoDB</span><span style="font-size:12pt">, following a modular architecture. The application separates routing, controllers, middleware, models, and utility modules to improve code maintainability and scalability. The backend exposes secure REST APIs for authentication, study material management, AI-powered content generation, and administrative operations.</span></p><h2 id="h.u10cxbv0g70y" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Backend Structure</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 254.50px; height: 463.55px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztZ0Rp8yNd5JolDuGo-CYMfvsqZGDdn7-42GUVNhOGjkobGKSpgWH13BB91VCkJHpJGEMdqqvSAHjM3rlNLtwuaPg_Si1nRaxkOqvjg5Ti7KIBw1MbPBGtKyT67My-4jV4i7cU5xDfOt-tb-J7hL0L5OjLtyXANTKA=s320" style="wi